					"bodyMarkdown": "## Purpose\nLet shoppers complete a purchase in two taps on mobile devices without duplicate payment charges.\n\n## How it works\nCart confirmation and payment authorization run as separate idempotent calls tied to an operation ID.\n\n## Rules\n- No order is charged twice even when the network drops and the shopper retries.\n- Every button stays at least 44 px tall below 640 px.\n\n## Known limitations\nSplit-tender gift card payments are not supported yet; shoppers must use a single payment method.\n\n## Non-goals\nOne-click guest checkout without review screen.\n",
